# Copy to .env (git-ignored) for development settings. API keys don't go here: Cutroom asks each person
# for their own, in onboarding or Settings → Media sources, and keeps them encrypted on the computer.
# Claude runs on your own Claude plan through Claude Code (sign in from Settings → Claude).

# Reuse an existing whisper.cpp install (a folder with its binary and models) instead of downloading one.
VEDIT_WHISPER_DIR=
